request.description:
Returns the plan with nested days[] and exercises[].
This response proves the Many-to-Many ORM join:
  WorkoutPlan → WorkoutPlanDays → PlanExercises ↔ Exercise

Expected shape:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "workoutPlanId": 1,
    "name": "...",
    "days": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "day": "monday",
        "exercises": [
          { "id": 1, "exerciseName": "Bench Press", "targetSets": 4, "targetReps": 8, "targetWeight": 60 }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "error": null
}

